#. ja: 「フォークタワー」は「蜃気楼の島 クレセントアイル」における<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>最高難易度のレイドコンテンツ</ui-edge-color></ui-color>です。<br>その攻略においては、参加者同士の協力と、各個人がサポートジョブの力を存分に発揮することが求められます。
#. de: Die Fork-Türme sind <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>die schwierigsten Raid-Inhalte</ui-edge-color></ui-color> auf Kreszentia.<br>Eine gute Zusammenarbeit und die clevere Anwendung von Phantomjobs sind ausschlaggebend, um sie erfolgreich zu stürmen.
#. fr: Les Tours fourchues sont des <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>raids de haute difficulté</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, les épreuves les plus ardues de l'île de Lunule.<br>Tirez la quintessence de vos jobs de soutien et coordonnez vos efforts avec les autres aventuriers pour les conquérir<nbsp>!
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:16699:0:0"
msgid "The Forked Towers are <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>the greatest challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to be found upon the Occult Crescent. Make full use of your phantom jobs and work in unison to overcome powerful foes and tricky battle mechanics."
msgstr "Башни-развилки — <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>самое сложное испытание</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Таинственного полумесяца. Объединяйтесь с другими участниками, в полной мере используйте возможности фантомных ролей и одолейте могучих врагов и коварные боевые механики."

